{"seq":2,"slug":"contracts","title":"契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/contracts","wordCount":722,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"契约\">契约</h1><p>Kotlin 契约（Contracts）是一种向编译器提供额外信息的机制，帮助编译器进行更智能的类型推断和流程分析。通过 <code>contract { }</code> DSL，开发者可以声明函数的调用语义，从而改善智能转换（smart cast）和可达性分析。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>契约的核心是<strong>向编译器提供它无法自行推断的调用语义</strong>：<code>contract { }</code> 声明诸如「返回 true 即意味着参数非空」「lambda 恰好被调用一次」这类事实，编译器据此放开智能转换、改进可达性分析。它把开发者掌握的确定性交还给类型检查器，弥补了控制流分析在函数边界处的盲区。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要契约\">为什么需要契约</h2><p>编译器无法自动推断所有函数的语义。考虑以下场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun isNotEmpty(s: String?): Boolean = s != null &amp;&amp; s.isNotEmpty()&#10;&#10;fun demo(input: String?) {&#10;    if (isNotEmpty(input)) {&#10;        // 编译错误：编译器不知道 isNotEmpty 返回 true 意味着 input 非空&#10;        // println(input.length)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun isNotEmpty(s: String?): Boolean = s != null &#x26;&#x26; s.isNotEmpty()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo(input: String?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (isNotEmpty(input)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 编译错误：编译器不知道 isNotEmpty 返回 true 意味着 input 非空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // println(input.length)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>契约告诉编译器：&quot;当 <code>isNotEmpty</code> 返回 <code>true</code> 时，参数一定非空&quot;，从而启用智能转换。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"contract-dsl\">contract { } DSL</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlin.contracts.*&#10;&#10;@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)&#10;fun isNotEmpty(s: String?): Boolean {&#10;    contract {&#10;        returns(true) implies (s != null)&#10;    }&#10;    return s != null &amp;&amp; s.isNotEmpty()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun demo(input: String?) {&#10;    if (isNotEmpty(input)) {&#10;        println(input.length) // 现在合法！编译器知道 input 非空&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlin.contracts.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun isNotEmpty(s: String?): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        returns(true) implies (s != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return s != null &#x26;&#x26; s.isNotEmpty()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo(input: String?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (isNotEmpty(input)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(input.length) // 现在合法！编译器知道 input 非空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 契约 API 目前仍标记为 <code>@ExperimentalContracts</code>，但已广泛用于标准库中。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"returns-implies\">returns implies</h2><p><code>returns implies</code> 声明函数返回特定值时，某个条件成立：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)&#10;fun requirePositive(value: Int?): Boolean {&#10;    contract {&#10;        returns(true) implies (value != null)&#10;    }&#10;    return value != null &amp;&amp; value &gt; 0&#10;}&#10;&#10;@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)&#10;fun assertNotNull(value: Any?) {&#10;    contract {&#10;        returns() implies (value != null) // returns() = 正常返回（不抛异常）&#10;    }&#10;    if (value == null) throw IllegalArgumentException(&quot;值不能为空&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun demo(name: String?) {&#10;    assertNotNull(name)&#10;    println(name.length) // 合法：编译器知道 name 非空&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun requirePositive(value: Int?): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        returns(true) implies (value != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return value != null &#x26;&#x26; value > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun assertNotNull(value: Any?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        returns() implies (value != null) // returns() = 正常返回（不抛异常）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (value == null) throw IllegalArgumentException(\"值不能为空\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo(name: String?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertNotNull(name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(name.length) // 合法：编译器知道 name 非空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>契约表达式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>returns(true) implies (x != null)</code></td>\n<td>返回 true 时 x 非空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>returns(false) implies (x == null)</code></td>\n<td>返回 false 时 x 为空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>returns() implies (x != null)</code></td>\n<td>正常返回时 x 非空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>returns(null) implies (x is Type)</code></td>\n<td>返回 null 时 x 是某类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"callsinplace\">callsInPlace</h2><p><code>callsInPlace</code> 声明 lambda 参数的调用语义——调用次数和位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)&#10;inline fun &lt;R&gt; myRun(block: () -&gt; R): R {&#10;    contract {&#10;        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)&#10;    }&#10;    return block()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun demo() {&#10;    val x: Int&#10;    myRun {&#10;        x = 42 // 合法：编译器知道 block 恰好执行一次&#10;    }&#10;    println(x) // 合法：x 一定已初始化&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>inline fun &#x3C;R> myRun(block: () -> R): R {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return block()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val x: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    myRun {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        x = 42 // 合法：编译器知道 block 恰好执行一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(x) // 合法：x 一定已初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>InvocationKind</code> 的取值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>种类</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>EXACTLY_ONCE</code></td>\n<td>恰好调用一次</td>\n<td>允许在 lambda 中初始化 <code>val</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AT_MOST_ONCE</code></td>\n<td>最多调用一次</td>\n<td>可以在 lambda 中赋值，但不能确保已初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AT_LEAST_ONCE</code></td>\n<td>至少调用一次</td>\n<td>允许在 lambda 中初始化 <code>val</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UNKNOWN</code></td>\n<td>未知次数</td>\n<td>默认，最保守</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"标准库中的契约\">标准库中的契约</h2><p>Kotlin 标准库大量使用契约来提升开发体验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// stdlib 中 require 的契约&#10;public inline fun require(value: Boolean) {&#10;    contract {&#10;        returns() implies value // 正常返回意味着 value 为 true&#10;    }&#10;    if (!value) throw IllegalArgumentException()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// stdlib 中 check 的契约&#10;public inline fun check(value: Boolean) {&#10;    contract {&#10;        returns() implies value&#10;    }&#10;    if (!value) throw IllegalStateException()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// stdlib 中 let/run/apply/also 的契约&#10;public inline fun &lt;T, R&gt; T.let(block: (T) -&gt; R): R {&#10;    contract {&#10;        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)&#10;    }&#10;    return block(this)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// stdlib 中 require 的契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public inline fun require(value: Boolean) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        returns() implies value // 正常返回意味着 value 为 true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!value) throw IllegalArgumentException()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// stdlib 中 check 的契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public inline fun check(value: Boolean) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        returns() implies value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!value) throw IllegalStateException()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// stdlib 中 let/run/apply/also 的契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public inline fun &#x3C;T, R> T.let(block: (T) -> R): R {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return block(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些契约使得以下代码合法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun process(input: Any?) {&#10;    require(input != null)&#10;    // 编译器知道 input 非空&#10;    println(input.toString())&#10;&#10;    require(input is String)&#10;    // 编译器知道 input 是 String&#10;    println(input.length)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun process(input: Any?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    require(input != null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 编译器知道 input 非空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(input.toString())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    require(input is String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 编译器知道 input 是 String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(input.length)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[require/check] --&gt;|正常返回| B[条件成立]&#10;    A --&gt;|抛出异常| C[条件不成立]&#10;    B --&gt; D[编译器启用 smart cast]\">flowchart LR\n    A[require/check] --&gt;|正常返回| B[条件成立]\n    A --&gt;|抛出异常| C[条件不成立]\n    B --&gt; D[编译器启用 smart cast]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义契约函数\">自定义契约函数</h2><h3 id=\"类型检查契约\">类型检查契约</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)&#10;fun Any?.isString(): Boolean {&#10;    contract {&#10;        returns(true) implies (this@isString is String)&#10;    }&#10;    return this is String&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun printLength(value: Any?) {&#10;    if (value.isString()) {&#10;        println(value.length) // smart cast 为 String&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Any?.isString(): Boolean {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        returns(true) implies (this@isString is String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return this is String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun printLength(value: Any?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (value.isString()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(value.length) // smart cast 为 String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"初始化保证契约\">初始化保证契约</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)&#10;inline fun &lt;T&gt; initOnce(block: () -&gt; T): T {&#10;    contract {&#10;        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)&#10;    }&#10;    return block()&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun demo() {&#10;    val connection: DatabaseConnection&#10;    val startTime: Long&#10;&#10;    initOnce {&#10;        connection = DatabaseConnection(&quot;localhost&quot;)&#10;        startTime = System.currentTimeMillis()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    println(connection) // 合法&#10;    println(startTime)  // 合法&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>inline fun &#x3C;T> initOnce(block: () -> T): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        callsInPlace(block, InvocationKind.EXACTLY_ONCE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return block()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun demo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val connection: DatabaseConnection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val startTime: Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    initOnce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        connection = DatabaseConnection(\"localhost\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startTime = System.currentTimeMillis()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(connection) // 合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(startTime)  // 合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"契约的限制\">契约的限制</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>只能在顶层函数或成员函数体的第一条语句</strong>：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun example() {&#10;    contract { /* ... */ } // 必须是第一条语句&#10;    // 其余代码&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun example() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contract { /* ... */ } // 必须是第一条语句</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 其余代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"2\">\n<li><p><strong>编译器信任但不验证</strong>：契约的正确性由开发者保证，错误的契约会导致运行时错误</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>不能用于抽象函数或接口方法</strong>：</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// interface Validator {&#10;//     fun isValid(s: String?): Boolean // 不能在接口中声明契约&#10;// }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// interface Validator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//     fun isValid(s: String?): Boolean // 不能在接口中声明契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"4\">\n<li><strong>目前仍为实验性 API</strong>：需要 <code>@OptIn(ExperimentalContracts::class)</code></li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 虽然是实验性 API，但标准库中广泛使用证明了其稳定性。在自定义代码中谨慎使用，确保契约声明与实际行为一致。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>契约</strong>向编译器提供函数的额外语义信息，改善类型推断和流程分析</li>\n<li><strong>returns implies</strong> 声明返回值与参数条件的关联，启用 smart cast</li>\n<li><strong>callsInPlace</strong> 声明 lambda 的调用次数，允许在 lambda 中安全初始化 <code>val</code></li>\n<li>标准库的 <code>require</code>、<code>check</code>、<code>let</code>、<code>run</code> 等函数都使用了契约</li>\n<li>契约的正确性由开发者保证，编译器信任但不验证</li>\n<li>限制：只能在函数体第一条语句、不能用于抽象方法、仍为实验性 API</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"契约","id":"契约"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要契约","id":"为什么需要契约"},{"level":2,"text":"contract { } DSL","id":"contract-dsl"},{"level":2,"text":"returns implies","id":"returns-implies"},{"level":2,"text":"callsInPlace","id":"callsinplace"},{"level":2,"text":"标准库中的契约","id":"标准库中的契约"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义契约函数","id":"自定义契约函数"},{"level":3,"text":"类型检查契约","id":"类型检查契约"},{"level":3,"text":"初始化保证契约","id":"初始化保证契约"},{"level":2,"text":"契约的限制","id":"契约的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"委托","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/delegation"},"next":{"title":"上下文接收者","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/context-receivers"}}